      "url": "https://newatlas.com/automotive/geely-galaxy-cruiser-700/",
      "title": "1,113-hp Galaxy Cruiser hybrid SUV redefines off-road power",
      "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"The Galaxy Cruiser 700 is a boxy plug-in hybrid\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b71f173/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1393+0+0/resize/1323x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F8a%2F3e62d76d4b83816fe4c9cbb918e5%2Fgeely-galaxy-zhanjian-700-2027-hd-fa4bb43c1c6010164837d4fec6cdb30b2b5e081ce.jpg\" /><p>I think we can all agree that proper, boxy SUVs are having a bit of an identity crisis. There was a time when they were slow, lumbering machines that traded speed for the ability to crawl over rocks and wade through rivers. Today, it seems every manufacturer wants one that can do all of that and embarrass a supercar at the traffic lights.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/automotive/geely-galaxy-cruiser-700/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/automotive/\">Automotive</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/transport/\">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/geely/\" rel=\"tag\">Geely</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/hybrid/\" rel=\"tag\">Hybrid</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/phev/\" rel=\"tag\">PHEV</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/suv/\" rel=\"tag\">SUV</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/off-road/\" rel=\"tag\">Off-road</a></p>",
