    {
      "id": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/31/ipad-air-could-be-redesigned-next-year/",
      "url": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/31/ipad-air-could-be-redesigned-next-year/",
      "title": "iPad Air Could Finally Be Redesigned Next Year",
      "content_html": "The <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-air/\">iPad Air</a> has looked the same since 2020, making it the longest-running design in Apple's tablet lineup. There is a reasonable case that 2027 could be when that comes to an end.\n<br />\n\n<br />\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-992557\" height=\"1102\" src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/03/M3-iPad-Air.jpg\" width=\"1960\" />\n<br />\nApple last gave the &zwnj;iPad Air&zwnj; a new enclosure in 2020, when the fourth-generation model introduced flat sides, an all-screen front, and <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/touch-id/\">Touch ID</a> in the top button. The subsequent <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/m1/\">M1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/m2/\">M2</a>, M3, and M4 updates were all internal with no design changes.\n<br />\n\n<br />\nThat could change next year. Apple is <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/15/report-ipad-air-to-gain-oled-display-next-year/\">expected to move the iPad Air to OLED in early 2027</a>, with Samsung Display supplying <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/16/2027-ipad-air-much-better-display/\">single-stack LTPS panels</a> that sit below the tandem <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/macbook-ultra/\">OLED</a> in the <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-pro/\">iPad Pro</a> on cost and brightness. The M5 chip is also rumored. That will form the largest change the product has had in years, and it comes as part of a <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/01/16/next-5-apple-products-with-oled-displays/\">wider OLED rollout</a> that will eventually reach products like the <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/imac/\">iMac</a> and <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-air/\">MacBook Air</a>.\n<br />\n\n<br />\nThe substantial upgrade would be a suitable candidate for a complete redesign. When the &zwnj;iPad Pro&zwnj; moved to &zwnj;OLED&zwnj; in 2024, Apple completely redesigned the device for the first time since 2018, introducing a substantially thinner chassis.\n<br />\n\n<br />\nMore strikingly, the <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-mini/\">iPad mini</a> 8 is <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/16/oled-ipad-mini-by-october-report/\">expected by October</a> with a new design, an <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/17/two-more-apple-devices-with-oled-displays/\">OLED display</a>, a <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2025/10/29/2026-ipad-mini-novel-speaker-system/\">vibration-based speaker system</a> that eliminates speaker holes, and a <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2025/10/28/ipad-mini-water-resistance/\">water-resistant casing</a> that would be an <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad/\">iPad</a> first. \n<br />\n\n<br />\nThe &zwnj;iPad Air&zwnj; and &zwnj;iPad mini&zwnj; have shared their design language since their introduction, with the mini most recently adopting the Air's look in 2021 and holding it through to the <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/ipad-mini-7/\">iPad mini 7</a>. If the mini receives a new enclosure this year, the Air is the obvious candidate to bring over the same one next. It could be much like how the original &zwnj;iPad mini&zwnj; from 2012 set the design standard for the &zwnj;iPad Air&zwnj; just a year later.  \n<br />\n\n<br />\nThere have been no specific rumors about an &zwnj;iPad Air&zwnj; redesign for next year, but if it does mirror the &zwnj;iPad mini&zwnj;, the device could gain the same vibration-based speaker system, water-resistance, and more.<div class=\"linkback\">Related Roundup: <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-air/\">iPad Air </a></div><div class=\"linkback\">Buyer's Guide: <a href=\"https://buyersguide.macrumors.com/#iPad-Air\">iPad Air (Buy Now)</a></div><div class=\"linkback\">Related Forum: <a href=\"https://forums.macrumors.com/forums/ipad.137\">iPad</a></div><br />This article, &quot;<a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/31/ipad-air-could-be-redesigned-next-year/\">iPad Air Could Finally Be Redesigned Next Year</a>&quot; first appeared on <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com\">MacRumors.com</a><br /><br /><a href=\"https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/ipad-air-could-finally-be-redesigned-next-year.2486256/\">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br /><br />",
      "date_published": "2026-08-01T01:00:11+00:00",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "MacRumors",
          "url": "https://www.macrumors.com"
        }
      ],
